{
  "slug": "claude-onboarding-agent",
  "name": "Claude Onboarding Agent",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Interactive onboarding agent that configures your Claude Code workspace for optimal use. Through guided questions, it generates tailored CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md files and installs the right skills for your workflow — whether you're coding, researching, writing, or managing projects.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills** and **4 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `academic-writing-setup` (Set up Claude for academic writing — thesis, paper, or dissertation), `anchors` (Refresh the anchor-derived marker sections in this project's CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md by re-fetching the latest anchors, diffing against…), `audit-setup` (Read-only audit of your current Claude setup — prints a prioritized HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW findings list covering package manager hygiene,…), `checkup` (The single user-facing maintenance entrypoint for an existing Claude setup), `coding-setup` (Set up Claude for software development — installs Superpowers, configures an iterative coding workflow (brainstorm → plan →…), `content-voice-setup` (Set up Claude for on-brand content voice), `data-science-setup` (Set up Claude for data science and ML engineering — configures notebook workflow, experiment tracking, reproducibility conventions, and…), `design-setup` (Set up Claude for UI/UX design tooling — wires up your design tool (Figma, Sketch, XD, Penpot) and…), and 8 more\n- **Agents** (4): `artifact-verifier` (Read-only subagent that confirms a list of files exists on disk and passes lightweight structural checks (non-empty, valid…), `audit-collector` (Read-only subagent that runs an audit skill (default `/audit-setup`) and returns a compact severity-bucketed finding summary), `repo-scanner` (Read-only subagent that scans a user project for language, framework, corpus-size, and use-case signals), `upgrade-planner` (Read-only subagent that enumerates plugin-owned delimited sections in a user project, diffs each against the canonical current template,…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-onboarding-agent@claude-community` from `a2ngerer/claude_onboarding_agent`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 16,
    "agent": 4
  },
